<title>SWITZERLAND: CYCLING-MENGIN WINS 16TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-MENGIN WINS 16TH STAGE OF TOUR DE FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>FRIBOURG, Switzerland 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Frenchman Christophe Mengin won the 16th stage of the Tour de France over 181 kms from Morzine on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Jan Ullrich of Germany retained the overall leader's yellow jersey.</p>
</text>
